title Vinyl now playing in portrait (draft NowPlaying-320x480): no app title in the band at the narrow portrait (the toolkit's rule: Esc left, strip right), one row of chips
sizes 320x480
ppmm 667
env VINYL_DEMO 1
env VINYL_DEMO_STATE playing

wait 1200
shot now-playing
expect esc
expect notext "Vinyl"
expect text "Phoenix"
expect text "Vol 60"
expect text "Queue"
expect text "Output"
expect noquit
